      "height": 36.9,
      "font_size": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "02",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 826,
      "width": 106,
      "height": 61.5,
      "font_size": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "THE METHOD",
      "x": 1297.5249343832022,
      "y": 826,
      "width": 921.5249343832022,
      "height": 61.5,
      "font_size": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "1  Discover candidates",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 961,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 54.12,
      "font_size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Fit coalition models on training data.<br/>Evaluate threshold crossings on validation data.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1034,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 94,
      "font_size": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "Exact enumeration or sampled search",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1164,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 39.36,
      "font_size": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "2  Gate proposed removals",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 54.12,
      "font_size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Let H be the candidate harmful set.<br/>Accept its removal only if:",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1383,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 94,
      "font_size": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "U<sub>val</sub>(N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> H) ≥ U<sub>val</sub>(N) - ε",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1505,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 58,
      "font_size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "ε = 0.005 (classification); 0.01 (regression)",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1577,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 40.589999999999996,
      "font_size": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "PASS: remove H  |  FAIL: remove nothing",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 39.36,
      "font_size": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "3  Evaluate &amp; optimize",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1769,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 54.12,
      "font_size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Use held-out test data for final reporting.<br/>Accepted subsets may prefilter NSGA-II.",
      "x": 1212.5249343832022,
      "y": 1844,
      "width": 976.5249343832022,
      "height": 94,
      "font_size": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "EXPERIMENTAL PROTOCOL",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 2041,
      "width": 1036.5249343832022,
      "height": 43.05,
      "font_size": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "6 datasets × 5 seeds",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 2106,
      "width": 1036.5249343832022,
      "height": 60.269999999999996,
      "font_size": 49
    },
    {
      "text": "64% train  /  16% validation  /  20% test",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 2181,
      "width": 1036.5249343832022,
      "height": 44.28,
      "font_size": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "XGBoost; α = 0.95; at most 100 analyzed features after training-only preprocessing.",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 2253,
      "width": 1036.5249343832022,
      "height": 92,
      "font_size": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "ROC AUC, OVR AUC or R².<br/>Controls delete the same accepted count.",
      "x": 1182.5249343832022,
      "y": 2400,
      "width": 1036.5249343832022,
      "height": 80,
      "font_size": 32
    },
